        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "To most of us, one feels stiff, but we may be ambiguous because it can refer just to the writer, to the writer and others but not the reader, to the writer and reader but not others, or to everyone. And if you are not directly addressing your reader (as we do), you is usually too casual.",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                412,
                772,
                513
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
